cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this software archive."
type: software
title: "Hearing the heat: analysis code"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for "Hearing the heat: a proof-of-concept study of nonlinear sound
  measures for distinguishing phases of rapid organic decomposition". Computes four
  nonlinear complexity measures and six conventional ecoacoustic indices in eight
  octave bands from 150 soil-probe recordings, fits temperature and time models with
  leave-one-bucket-out cross-validation, runs the temperature-surrogate tests and
  reproduces all numbers, tables and figures of the article and its supplement.
